-captcha=\"math\" data-is-wrapped-field=\"1\" name=\"wpforms[fields][6][a]\" aria-describedby=\"wpforms-28-field_6-question\" required>\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"wpforms[fields][6][cal]\" class=\"cal\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"wpforms[fields][6][n2]\" class=\"n2\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"wpforms[fields][6][n1]\" class=\"n1\">\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div><script>\n\t\t\t\t( function() {\n\t\t\t\t\tconst style = document.createElement( 'style' );\n\t\t\t\t\tstyle.appendChild( document.createTextNode( '#wpforms-28-field_5-container { position: absolute !important; overflow: hidden !important; display: inline !important; height: 1px !important; width: 1px !important; z-index: -1000 !important; padding: 0 !important; } #wpforms-28-field_5-container input { visibility: hidden; } #wpforms-conversational-form-page #wpforms-28-field_5-container label { counter-increment: none; }' ) );\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.head.appendChild( style );\n\t\t\t\t\tdocument.currentScript?.remove();\n\t\t\t\t} )();\n\t\t\t<\/script><\/div><!-- .wpforms-field-container --><div class=\"wpforms-submit-container\" ><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"wpforms[id]\" value=\"28\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page_title\" value=\"\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page_url\" value=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1547\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url_referer\" value=\"http:\/\/francomunoz.com\/san-anselmo-workers-compensation-attorneys\/\"><button type=\"submit\" name=\"wpforms[submit]\" id=\"wpforms-submit-28\" class=\"wpforms-submit\" data-alt-text=\"Sending...\" data-submit-text=\"Please Review My Case\" aria-live=\"assertive\" value=\"wpforms-submit\">Please Review My Case<\/button><\/div><\/form><\/div>  <!-- .wpforms-container --><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1547-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1547-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1547-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"3\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h2>Marin County Workers' Compensation Lawyer: Experienced Legal Help for Injured Workers in Marin<\/h2>\n<p>If you\u2019ve been injured on the job in Marin County, you deserve experienced legal support to navigate California\u2019s complex workers\u2019 compensation system. At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we understand the physical, emotional, and financial challenges you face. Whether you\u2019re dealing with a recent injury or struggling to get the benefits you\u2019re entitled to, our trusted workers\u2019 compensation attorneys are here to help you every step of the way.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-1510 alignnone lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/logo-1024x487.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"487\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/logo-1024x487.png 1024w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/logo-300x143.png 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/logo-768x366.png 768w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/logo.png 1370w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/487;\" \/><\/p>\n<h2>Why Choose Franco Mu\u00f1oz for Your Marin County Workers\u2019 Compensation Claim?<\/h2>\n<p>At our new Marin County location, we bring the same level of dedicated service and proven results that have made us one of the top-rated workers\u2019 compensation law firms in Northern California. Here\u2019s why injured workers in Marin trust us:<\/p>\n<p>- <strong>Decades of Experience:<\/strong> Our team has successfully handled thousands of workers\u2019 compensation cases across California, recovering millions of dollars in settlements for our clients.<br \/>\n- <strong>Local Expertise:<\/strong> We know the nuances of Marin County\u2019s workers\u2019 compensation claims process, including how to navigate local WCAB offices and medical providers.<br \/>\n- <strong>No Fees Unless We Win:<\/strong> We work on a contingency basis, so you don\u2019t pay any fees unless we secure benefits or a settlement for you.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1512 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FM-Law-Marin-County-office-photo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FM-Law-Marin-County-office-photo.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FM-Law-Marin-County-office-photo-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FM-Law-Marin-County-office-photo-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/FM-Law-Marin-County-office-photo-768x768.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/1024;\" \/><\/p>\n<h2>Your Rights After a Workplace Injury in Marin County<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In California, workers\u2019 compensation benefits are designed to help you recover and return to work after an injury. However, the process can be overwhelming, and many injured workers face delays or denials. At Franco Mu\u00f1oz, we fight tirelessly to ensure you receive the full benefits you\u2019re entitled to, including:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul style=\"margin-left: 0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Medical Treatment:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Coverage for necessary medical care, including doctor visits, surgeries, medications, and physical therapy.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Temporary Disability Benefits:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Payments to cover lost wages if you are unable to work while you recover from your injury.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Permanent Disability Benefits<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Compensation if your injury results in a lasting impairment or disability.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Vocational Rehabilitation<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Assistance if you cannot return to your previous job, including vocational training and job placement services.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2>Common Workplace Injuries We Handle in Marin County<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Workplace injuries can happen in any industry, whether you\u2019re working in construction, healthcare, retail, or an office setting. Some common types of injuries our clients experience include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul style=\"margin-left: 0;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">-<\/span><b> Back and Neck Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: These injuries often result from heavy lifting, repetitive movements, or slip-and-fall accidents.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Carpal Tunnel Syndrome<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Repetitive strain injuries are common for office workers and those using heavy machinery.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Construction Accidents<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Including falls, equipment malfunctions, and injuries from hazardous materials.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Head and Brain Injuries<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Resulting from slip-and-falls or being struck by falling objects.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">- <\/span><b>Hearing Loss<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Caused by prolonged exposure to loud noises without adequate protection.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019ve suffered any of these injuries or another type of workplace accident, contact our Marin County office today for a free consultation. We will review your case and help you understand your options for getting the medical treatment and compensation you deserve.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1514 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-workers.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-workers.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-workers-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-workers-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-workers-768x768.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/1024;\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1547-1-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"4\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h2><b>Our Marin County Office Location<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Conveniently located for clients throughout Marin County, our office is easily accessible and ready to serve you. Whether you\u2019re coming from San Rafael, Novato, Mill Valley, or any of the surrounding areas, we provide the same compassionate and aggressive representation you\u2019ve come to expect from Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Our Marin County Office Address:<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm - Marin County\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">1000 4th Street<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Suite 300<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">San Rafael, CA 94901<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><\/p>\n<p><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Office Hours: Monday - Friday, 8 AM - 6 PM<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1516 lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-office-location.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-office-location.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-office-location-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-office-location-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Marin-County-location-photo-of-office-location-768x768.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/1024;\" \/><\/p>\n<h2>What to Expect at Your Free Consultation<\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm, we believe every client deserves personal attention and a tailored approach. Here\u2019s what you can expect when you visit our Marin County office for your free consultation:<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><b>In-Depth Case Evaluation<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: We\u2019ll listen to your story, review any documents you have, and give you a straightforward assessment of your claim.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><b>Clear Explanation of Your Rights<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: You\u2019ll leave with a better understanding of your rights under California workers\u2019 compensation law and the next steps we recommend.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><b>No Pressure, No Obligation<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: We\u2019re here to provide the information you need to make the best decision for your situation. If you decide to work with us, we\u2019ll get started immediately on building a strong case.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3>Serving All of Marin County with Compassion and Integrity<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Our office in Marin County is committed to delivering the same high-quality legal representation that has made Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law Firm a trusted name across the Bay Area. We handle every case with the dedication and care it deserves because we know what\u2019s at stake for you and your family.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Contact us today at <a href=\"tel:5102574141\">(510) 257-4141<\/a> or fill out the contact form below to schedule your free, no-obligation consultation. Let us help you get the benefits you deserve so you can focus on your recovery.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large lazyload\" data-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/webp-express\/webp-images\/doc-root\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/team.jpg.webp\" width=\"1500\" height=\"400\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSI